flowchart LR
 subgraph Separate[Three separate GPU kernels]
 A[Read input] --> B[Multiply] --> C[Write intermediate 1]
 C --> D[Read intermediate 1] --> E[Add bias] --> F[Write intermediate 2]
 F --> G[Read intermediate 2] --> H[Activation] --> I[Write output]
 end
 subgraph Fused[One fused GPU kernel]
 J[Read input] --> K[Multiply + Add + Activation] --> L[Write output]
 end
